Project: weekly goals tracker (MyFitnessPal-style, but for weekly targets).
Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript (strict), plain CSS in app/globals.css. Mobile-first UI.

Core rules:
- Goal progress is DERIVED from logs, never stored. Planned sessions are
  reminders only and do not affect completion.
- Dates are "YYYY-MM-DD" strings. Weeks run Monday to Sunday (dayOfWeek 0 = Monday).
  No time-based date maths with timezones.
- All storage goes through lib/storage.ts so localStorage can be swapped for
  Supabase later.
- Pure logic lives in lib/week.ts and must have Vitest tests (lib/week.test.ts).
- Small components, no new dependencies without asking.
- Tap targets >= 44px, design for 390px width first.


